WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.520
San Mateo, Kapitulo 28

00:03.520 --> 00:07.080
Kalpasan ti Aldawa panaginana,

00:07.760 --> 00:10.620
idipumarbangon iti umunang Aldaw Tilawas,

00:11.220 --> 00:13.200
na pankinita ni Maria Magdalena

00:13.200 --> 00:14.660
kinti sa bali ang Maria

00:14.660 --> 00:16.540
tinakaitaniman ni Jesus.

00:17.480 --> 00:18.240
Pagamuan,

00:18.700 --> 00:20.360
nagginginid itinapiksa,

00:21.060 --> 00:22.700
bimabati may sanganghel

00:22.700 --> 00:24.300
ti apo manipudlangit.

00:24.980 --> 00:26.280
Tinulid na ti batoan

00:26.280 --> 00:27.460
ay siray ititanem

00:27.460 --> 00:28.960
sana nagtugawan.

00:28.960 --> 00:31.360
Maka purar akas lakimat

00:31.360 --> 00:32.020
ti langana

00:32.020 --> 00:33.820
kin nakapudpudaw

00:33.820 --> 00:34.800
ti pagananay na.

00:35.420 --> 00:37.400
Nagtigirger dagiti kwardya

00:37.400 --> 00:38.840
gapuiti butenda

00:38.840 --> 00:40.820
kit kaslanatay ti langada.

00:41.620 --> 00:42.760
Nagsauti anghel

00:42.760 --> 00:43.780
kadagiti babay.

00:44.460 --> 00:45.760
Di kay agbuteng.

00:46.460 --> 00:47.060
Kinunana.

00:47.840 --> 00:48.380
Amo,

00:48.580 --> 00:50.060
asap sa polonyo ni Jesus

00:50.060 --> 00:51.620
ana ilansa iti kros.

00:52.500 --> 00:53.560
Awan dito yun.

00:54.520 --> 00:55.220
Nagungaren

00:55.220 --> 00:56.560
kas iti kinunana.

00:57.220 --> 00:58.700
Umayo kitaen

00:58.700 --> 00:59.500
ti lugar

00:59.500 --> 01:00.340
anagidaan na.

01:01.180 --> 01:01.980
Kalpasan na

01:01.980 --> 01:03.860
inkay ipakaam mo

01:03.860 --> 01:04.460
adagos

01:04.460 --> 01:05.820
kadagiti adalan na

01:05.820 --> 01:06.680
at nagungaren.

01:07.720 --> 01:08.640
Umununan to

01:08.640 --> 01:09.540
ngamda kayo

01:09.540 --> 01:10.900
amapan ijay

01:10.900 --> 01:11.540
galilya.

01:12.580 --> 01:13.880
Makita yun to sa jay.

01:14.820 --> 01:15.680
Tandaanan nyo

01:15.680 --> 01:16.300
da ito'y

01:16.300 --> 01:17.460
imbagak kada kayo.

01:18.160 --> 01:19.160
Nagdardaras da

01:19.160 --> 01:20.520
apimanaw ititanem

01:20.520 --> 01:22.440
nupay sibubuting da

01:22.440 --> 01:24.500
napnguan da itirago

01:24.500 --> 01:26.320
kaya't nagtartaray da

01:26.320 --> 01:27.620
anapan ng ipakaam mo

01:27.620 --> 01:28.220
itidamag

01:28.220 --> 01:28.680
kadagiti adalaman.

01:28.700 --> 01:30.660
Pagamuan

01:30.660 --> 01:32.440
sinabat ida ni Jesus

01:32.440 --> 01:34.340
kit kinablaawan na ida.

01:35.020 --> 01:36.380
Imasidig da kinkwana

01:36.380 --> 01:37.740
kit inarakop da

01:37.740 --> 01:39.100
dagiti saka na

01:39.100 --> 01:40.700
sada nagdaydayaw kinkwana.

01:42.060 --> 01:43.160
Di kayagbuteng.

01:43.960 --> 01:45.120
Kinunan ni Jesus

01:45.120 --> 01:47.120
inkay ibagahak

01:47.120 --> 01:48.320
kadagiti kakabsat ko

01:48.320 --> 01:50.560
amapanda iti galilya

01:50.560 --> 01:52.880
kit makita dakto sa jay.

01:54.880 --> 01:55.880
Kabayatan na

01:55.880 --> 01:56.700
itinakapanawin

01:56.700 --> 01:57.700
dagiti babae

01:58.700 --> 01:59.980
na pan iti syudad

01:59.980 --> 02:00.840
ti sumagmamano

02:00.840 --> 02:02.040
kadagiti soldado

02:02.040 --> 02:03.660
anag gwardya ititanem

02:03.660 --> 02:05.340
kit impadamag da

02:05.340 --> 02:06.420
kadagiti pangulwen

02:06.420 --> 02:07.080
apapadi

02:07.080 --> 02:08.640
ti amin na napasamak

02:08.640 --> 02:10.860
nakiuman dagiti pangulwen

02:10.860 --> 02:11.500
apapadi

02:11.500 --> 02:12.760
kadagiti panglakayen.

02:13.520 --> 02:15.160
Kalpasan ti panagtutulag da

02:15.160 --> 02:17.480
inikanda dagiti soldado

02:17.480 --> 02:18.780
iti aduwa kuwarta

02:18.780 --> 02:20.320
sa naimpilin.

02:21.040 --> 02:22.800
Ibagayo kadagiti tattao

02:22.800 --> 02:24.360
nga imay dagiti adalan na

02:24.360 --> 02:25.140
itirabi i

02:25.140 --> 02:26.120
katinakaw da

02:26.120 --> 02:27.000
iti bangkay na

02:27.000 --> 02:28.420
idi matmaturo kayo.

02:28.700 --> 02:30.080
Numaamuan da ito

02:30.080 --> 02:31.000
iti gobernador

02:31.000 --> 02:33.280
dakamto iti makisarita

02:33.280 --> 02:34.700
kinkwana tapnoawan

02:34.700 --> 02:35.860
iti pakaano-anoan nyo.

02:36.560 --> 02:37.300
Itikasta,

02:37.940 --> 02:39.360
inala dagiti gwardya

02:39.360 --> 02:40.000
ti kuwarta

02:40.000 --> 02:41.560
kit inaramida

02:41.560 --> 02:42.460
tinaibagang

02:42.460 --> 02:43.340
nga aramidin da.

02:44.040 --> 02:45.120
Da ito iti damag

02:45.120 --> 02:46.780
anagwaras kadagiti hudyo

02:46.780 --> 02:48.920
agpapan kadagitoing aldaw.

02:49.660 --> 02:50.960
Napandagiti sangapulo

02:50.960 --> 02:52.260
kit may sangadalan

02:52.260 --> 02:54.060
itibantay iti galilya

02:54.060 --> 02:55.680
nga imbaga ni Jesus

02:55.680 --> 02:56.540
apapananda.

02:56.540 --> 02:58.540
Idi makita da ni Jesus

02:58.700 --> 03:00.500
nagdaydayo da

03:00.500 --> 03:01.180
kinkwana

03:01.180 --> 03:03.220
numumpay nagduwa-duwa

03:03.220 --> 03:04.080
iti sumagmamanu

03:04.080 --> 03:04.720
kadakwada

03:04.720 --> 03:06.600
immasidig na Jesus

03:06.600 --> 03:07.760
kit kinunana.

03:08.560 --> 03:09.660
Naitad kanyak

03:09.660 --> 03:10.380
ti amin

03:10.380 --> 03:11.460
apan nakabalin

03:11.460 --> 03:12.280
iti langit

03:12.280 --> 03:13.420
kyan dito'y daga.

03:14.220 --> 03:15.000
Inkay ngarod

03:15.000 --> 03:16.020
kadagiti amin

03:16.020 --> 03:16.800
at tattao

03:16.800 --> 03:18.000
iti amin alugar

03:18.000 --> 03:20.040
kit pagbalinin nyo

03:20.040 --> 03:21.040
ita nga adala.

03:22.120 --> 03:23.340
Bunyagan nyo ita

03:23.340 --> 03:24.440
itinagan ti ama

03:24.440 --> 03:25.700
ti anak

03:25.700 --> 03:27.940
kyan ti Espiritu Santo.

03:28.700 --> 03:29.700
Kyan isuro yung

03:29.700 --> 03:30.700
itangagtong pal

03:30.700 --> 03:31.740
kadagiti amin

03:31.740 --> 03:32.680
nga inbilin ko

03:32.680 --> 03:33.240
kadakayo.

03:34.080 --> 03:35.000
Laglagipan nyo

03:35.000 --> 03:36.800
nga at taaktong

03:36.800 --> 03:37.560
agnanayon

03:37.560 --> 03:38.120
kadakayo

03:38.120 --> 03:39.420
aging ga

03:39.420 --> 03:41.140
itipanong palan

03:41.140 --> 03:41.980
tilubong.

